Used, not distributed
---------------------

OpenSSL (https://www.openssl.org, Apache License 2.0) is loaded when byj
starts, from the system's own install (Homebrew's openssl@3 on macOS); no
byj binary contains it.

jolt-lang/nrepl v0.1.2 (6e8cfa21, https://github.com/jolt-lang/nrepl,
Eclipse Public License 2.0) is a development dependency (deps.edn's :dev alias) and is in no
binary, as are the npm packages the ACP interoperability check and the SDK
spike install (dev/acp-interop, dev/sdk-acp-spike; their package-lock.json
files name them).


The Agent SDK
